        <![CDATA[<p>Az and the king of FPL content are on hand to recap their GW 25 scores and look ahead to GW 26. A certain Cole Palmer is back on the menu, and which Arsenal players are "optimal" for the Double? Should we be considering our Triple Captaincy chip on Gabriel? Also included are all the key stats and their own transfers and plans going forwards.

---</p>
