    <item>
      <title>Final Destination | Gameweek 38 | FPL 24/25 | EP.175</title>
      <description>Az and Andy team up to talk all things Gameweek 38. Andy has soared into the top 100k with Az languishing behind with no realistic chance of making it this season. Dissapointing.

But, there's plenty of points to be had, so for one final time, let's regroup and talk about which players in this silly Fantasy game are going to score us the most points, secure mini-leagues and propel us up the rankings.


