    <item>
      <title>That's Rich | FPL BB EP. 116 | Gameweek 6 | FPL 23/24</title>
      <description>Thanks Mark for the title of this episode...

It was a brutal week for the majority of FPL managers, but one of the FPL BlackBox boys is sitting pretty (Spoiler: It isn't Az). With Mark having such a good start to the season and Az... well, not, there's maybe something to learn from both managers with contrasting fortunes.

Tune in for team and player analysis, potential Wildcards and some (hopefully) gentle ribbing.
