    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - EP. 69 - Unlikely Saviours</title>
      <link>https://youtu.be/S4Gx8i_rgko</link>
      <description>Reinforced as a trio once again, the Blackbox crew are back a licking their wounds from a Gameweek that hasn't even ended.
Somehow, despite playing their Free Hit chips and Luke taking a 12-point hit, it's Az and Mark left smarting as their short-term loan signings flopped and shipped assets prospered. A cruel outcome that leaves the pair searching data and fixtures for players who can repair the damage.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
