    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - EP. 66 - Eye of the Storm</title>
      <link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W8WOOxZAysk&amp;t=4217s</link>
      <description>Az (@ffscout_az) and Luke (@ffscout_luke) are joined by an ex-winner of FPL, Mr. Josh Bull, who won the crown in the 19/20 season. Josh has remained an avid player of FPL since his triumph, and shares his wisdom ahead of the Gameweek 32 deadline.

It's "The Eye of the Storm", or rather, finally a "normal" looking Gameweek that doesn't feature Doubles or Blanks. But it's no time to rest on your laurels, with just 7 Gameweek's of the season to go, every transfer and captaincy decision is crucial.

The trio will also be looking at all the regular stuff, including:

The Great and the Good
Player / Team data
Captains Matrix
GW29 Fixture predictions...

...and more!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
