      <itunes:title>FPL BB - EP. 65 - Toffee Crunch</itunes:title>
      <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
      <itunes:season>2</itunes:season>
      <itunes:episode>65</itunes:episode>
      <itunes:author>Az, Andy, and Luke</itunes:author>
      <itunes:subtitle>FPL BB - EP. 65 - Toffee Crunch</itunes:subtitle>
      <itunes:summary>The FPL BlackBox boys, Az (@ffscout_az) and Luke (@ffscout_luke) are here for Gameweek 31 to talk about an... interesting... double Gameweek for strugglers Burnley and Everton.

With one manager planning a 8 points hit worth of transfers, and the other maybe looking to save the transfer, it's clear both managers are going in different directions this week. 

As well as touching on the best players to own for the upcoming double, the duo will also be looking at all the regular stuff, including:

The Great and the Good
Player / Team data
Captains Matrix
GW29 Fixture predictions...

...and more!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
