      <title>FPL BB - EP. 64 - Fill in the Blanks</title>
      <link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=691gHTOhy50</link>
      <description>Where is Mark?
Where is Mark?

Here is Mark!

Mark (@ffscout_mark) returns to FPL Blackbox ahead of maybe the most underwhelming Gameweek of the season. He won't be happy that his co-host Az (@ffscout_az) is currently sat just outside the top 1k, while Mark continues to hover outside the top 100k. What a complete contrast to last season, where these roles were flipped.

As well as touching on the best players to own for the blank Gameweek, the duo will also be looking at all the regular stuff, including:

The Great and the Good
Player / Team data
Captains Matrix
GW29 Fixture predictions...

...and more!
