    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - EP. 61 - Wout About That</title>
      <link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eMvAUoUlQMo&amp;t=6s</link>
      <description>Two Fantasy Football Scout employees chat about all things FPL, as Az is joined by legendary manager Tom Freeman.

For those of you who don't know, in 12 seasons, Tom has finished in the top 1k an astounding 5 times, with a best finish of 214th in 2018/19. Over this period, Tom has also only finished outside the top 100k once, and has an average finish of 26,876. Ridiculous.

With chips having been played in Gameweek 26, and many looking to be played in Gameweek 27, there's clear a lot to discuss.

They'll also be looking at all the usual stuff such as:

The Great and the Good
Player / Team data
Captains Matrix
GW27 Fixture predictions...

...and more!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
