      <title>FPL BB - EP. 59 - Focal Point</title>
      <link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gDCjvN8k3UA&amp;t=1663s</link>
      <description>Az chats to Oscar a.k.a. FPL Focal about his incredible season so far, which see's him currently at 26th in the overall FPL rankings!

But, having been 2nd for much of the season, this is a bit of a slide for Oscar. What are his plans going forward to try and push for that #1 spot?

They'll also be looking at all the usual stuff such as:

The Great and the Good
Player / Team data
Captains Matrix
GW16 Fixture predictions...

...and more!
