      <description>Join Mark and Az for the second FPL BlackBox of Gameweek 21. With a couple of new signings in the bag, the duo will be taking a look at the likes of Phil Coutinho, Kieran Trippier… and the mighty Chris Wood. Can this unlikely trio have an impact on our Fantasy seasons?

They will also be having another stock check at the state of play of Double Gameweek 22, including Chip strategies, Free Hits and more.
