    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 56 - Slim Pickings</title>
      <link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TP8M0GYi3AE</link>
      <description>With the announcement of the Double Gameweek ahead of GW22, the BlackBox boys are turning their attention to the offerings at their disposal.

The only problem is there isn't much to get excited about. Or is there?

As part of a comprehensive review of all things Double Gameweek, the duo will be talking about transfer targets, Free Hit and Chip plans, as well as checking team and player data and their Watchlist.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 07 Jan 2022 13:53:00 -0000</pubDate>
