    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 54 - Wreck it Ralf</title>
      <link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sgv5Fz7pgSM&amp;t=2489s</link>
      <description>Az chats to Simon March, winner of the Fantasy Premier League 2014/15 season.

Despite winning the game, Simon has remained an active part of the FPL community, and boasts 5 finishes inside the top 60k in the last 5 seasons since he won.

In this episode, they'll be chatting about how the appointment of Ralf Rangnick, combined with United's brilliant fixtures, could mean the current template is well, wrecked.

They'll also be looking at all the usual stuff such as:

The Great and the Good
Player / Team data
Captains Matrix
GW16 Fixture predictions...

...and more!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
