    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 53 - Topguns Takeover</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>Az and Luke turn time back a few years and reunite for a FPL TopGuns reunion! The two "maverick" FPL managers started a podcast a few seasons ago, before life got in the way and they had to cease recording. Things are different now. There's more tech, more stats... but this episode will roll back the years as the two combine for a slightly more informal look at the season so far and plans heading in to the festive period.

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
