    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 51 - Back Four Good</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>The worm has very much turned on FPL BlackBox, with Az stretching his lead over Mark to epic proportions and threatening to claim top spot in the Great and the Good league. But Mark is sure to relish the challenge and go all out to reel his co-host rival. Elsewhere in this week's episode, the pair discuss Antonio Conte's arrival at Spurs and the lure of the FPL back four setup ahead of Gameweek 11. 

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
