    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 49 - Broken Promises</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>Az and Mark return for another episode of FPL BlackBox ahead of Gameweek 9, to find themselves troubled by their heavy-hitter strikers.  
 
Not so long ago, all the talk was about going "Threemium" and getting on board with both Ronaldo and Lukaku, now, weeks later we have growing doubts about both.
 
The boys assess that shift in confidence ahead of a classic form vs fixtures scenario, as Salah maintains his incredible run of form ahead of his clash with Man United. Which way will Az and Mark fall? It's a subject for much debate. 

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
