    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 47 - Shots Fired</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>Az is back following his house move and joins up with Mark to tackle the ever shifting Fantasy landscape ahead of Gameweek 7. Arsenal's emergence as a potential force gets some attention, while a rash of defensive casualties undermine last week's cry to go "big at the back". The BlackBox duo respond to both with a full stock check of each position and a glimpse of their would-be Wildcard squads should they press that button.

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
