    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 46 - Go Big At The Back?</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>While the Cat's away moving to Hitchin, the mice will play. In this case the mice in question are Mark and guest co-host Luke as they take assume control while Az undergoes his house move. There's much to discuss, not least the new movement towards big investment in defence that's rapidly gaining momentum of the starts made by Chelsea, Man City and Liverpool. Elsewhere, Mark and Luke look back on Gameweek 5, but turn much of their attention to what the forthcoming weekend has in store and and discuss whether to hold on Diogo Jota and Ferran Torres, or move to three up front and embrace the charms of Allan Saint-Maximin.

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
