    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 44 - Back To Business</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>The international break is nearly over (thank the Maker) and after the record-breaking episode last time out, the FPL BlackBox boys have got a lot to live up to. To be honest, those boots might be a bit too big to fill, but they'll do their best, and Mark has some extra stats on Man U with Cavani (at Az's request). And as always, the boys preview the Gameweek to come with lots of chat on the captaincy despite Ronaldo's arrival.  
 
 

