      <description>As the 21/22 Premier League season draws near, its time to have a look at your team and think… how template am I? If the answer is "very", then you're going to get a very stern telling off from resident maverick @ffscout_luke, who joins Mark and Az as a guest on tonights pod. The three of them will be looking at ways to smash the template, who we should be considering and who is flying under the radar.

