    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 36 - Sprint Finish</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>This is it. The final Gameweek. I hope you are all where you want to be… but lets be honest, if you're not no.1 (Hi Ola), you can still do better. 
So what's the plan? Settle for what you've got? Or is it time for a last ditch punt to try and climb the ranks? 
In such a crucial, chaotic Gameweek, we be looking at each position in turn in pursuit of the "Difference Maker" who can help power a final sprint.

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
