    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 35 - Sunday Service</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>Well there's only two Gameweeks to go in the final week of the season. What are you playing for? Fighting to get into the top 1k? 10k? 100k? Or are you just waiting for the season to end to go again next year.
 
It's been a hell of a ride, and Az and Mark are here to try and help you make those final few decisions as we steam towards the end of the most volatile season in memory. In this episode they focus on the mid-price midfielder options for the last two matches, as the highly-owned Diogo Jota hits the treatment room and Jesse Lingard dips in form. 

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
