    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 34 - With a Bang!</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>We're entering into the final straight now, with three massive Gameweeks rounding up a relentless 2020/2021 season. We hope your spreadsheet is made, your brain is engaged and you know what you need to do. But if you don't, then Az and Mark are here to pick out some "difference makers" who can help ensure the campaign ends on a high.
As always, we'll also be looking at:
Gameweek ReviewThe Great and the Good StandingsTeam data – Defence and AttackPlayer DataCaptain Matrix and Data...and more!

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
