    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 33 - Triple Threat</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>Wow. Who would have thought Manchester United would have a Triple Gameweek? This. Is. Massive. With just one United player between Az and Mark's line-ups and hits needed to change that, this is an agonising scenario but one that has to be embraced by those set up to exploit it. The BlackBox pair take a deep dive on United's data, line them up vs other Double Gameweek assets and give their view on how you use your remaining chips ahead of this extraordinary set of matches. 

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
