    <item>
      <title>'FPL BB - Ep. 32 - Sliding Doors</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>Time is ticking on, can you believe there are only 5 Gameweek's left of the season?! Every transfer is crucial now. Every decision needs to be well thought out and rationalised. And boy are there some decisions to be made. If you sold Kane for Vardy, to you get him straight back in? What do we do with Bruno Fernandes? Is all of our investment in Wolves defenders and Liverpool assets misplaced? There’s plenty to discuss for the BlackBox Crew to discuss then. And they’ll also be tackling all the usual stuff:
Gameweek Review The Great and the Good StandingsTeam data – Defence and AttackPlayer DataCaptain Matrix and Data ...and more!

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
