    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 31 - As You Were</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>Did you have a playing Goalkeeper this week? Unless it was Rui Patricio or Robert Sanchéz, you're probably cursing your luck.
We are now entering a Blank Gameweek and the two teams that have it are in slightly different places in our FPL thoughts – Spurs for example come straight back into a decent run of games, whereas Manchester City rotation continues to hit hard.
There’s plenty to discuss for the BlackBox Crew to discuss then. And they’ll also be tackling all the usual stuff:
Gameweek Review
The Great and the Good Standings
Team data – Defence and Attack
Player Data
Captain Matrix and Data
...and more!
-------------------

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
