    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 28 - Opportunity Knocks</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>Finally. The international break is over and we can resume our quests for Green Arrows and to ascend up the rankings.
We've had the news that a DGW is just a few weeks away… although it only happens to feature one team. Does this change our Wildcard thinking?
Gameweek 30 also looks a prime week for going for a couple of tasty differentials. Who is there that we should be considering?
Clearly, there’s plenty to discuss for the BlackBox Crew to discuss then. And they’ll also be tackling all the usual stuff:
Gameweek Review
The Great and the Good Standings
Team data – Defence and Attack
Player Data
Doubles + Blanks
Captain Matrix and Data
...and more!

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
