    <item>
      <title>FPL BB – Ep. 26 - Firing Blanks</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>And here it is. Quite possibly the most underwhelming Gameweek we've ever had.
There are 8 teams playing, no standout game, Spurs have just got knocked out of the Europa League by a team whose manager has just been sent to prison Zoran Mamic. Arsenal have struggled through with Aubameyang missing a whole host of chances and it seems like people are turning to Brighton to be the heroes we oh so desperately need.
God help us.
Clearly, there’s plenty to discuss for the BlackBox Crew to discuss then. And they’ll also be tackling all the usual stuff:
Gameweek ReviewThe Great and the Good StandingsTeam data – Defence and AttackPlayer DataDoubles + BlanksGW 29 fixturesCaptain Matrix and Data...and more!
 

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
