    <item>
      <title>FPL BB – Ep. 25 – FoMo</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>Another Double Gameweek comes and goes and many of us have once again fallen victim to Pep Roulette.
Congratulations to those who went for De Bruyne, or who handed the armband to Kane or Gundogan – but for many of us, this Gameweek was yet another one to forget.
The next couple of weeks look tricky to navigate, so clearly, there’s plenty to discuss for the BlackBox Crew to discuss then. And they’ll also be tackling all the usual stuff:
Gameweek Review
The Great and the Good Standings
Team data – Defence and Attack
Player Data – What’s up with Mohamed Salah?
GW 28 fixtures and predictions
Captain Matrix and Data
...and more!
