    <item>
      <title>FPL BB – Ep. 22 – Wham Bam!</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>So with the last Gameweek pretty much decided on whether you captained Gundogan or not – we move in to another Double Gameweek.
They are coming thick and fast.
We’d hoped to have had some fixture news but it doesn’t look like these won’t be coming. Not helpful for anyone on a Wildcard unless they come pretty soon however.
Clearly, there’s plenty to discuss for the BlackBox Crew to discuss then. And they’ll also be tackling all the usual stuff:
Gameweek Review
Top 10k Stats and the Great and the Good Standings
Team data – Defence and Attack
Player Data
Doubles + Blanks
GW 25 fixtures and
Captain Matrix and Data
...and more!
