    <item>
      <title>FPL BB – Ep. 18 – Half Time</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>We’ve reached the halfway point and what a season its been so far.
Mr. Mark Sutherns has just broken into the top 100k but on the other end of the scale, Dr Az has crawled his way into the top million.
While the two managers were battling it out around the same ranking in GW8, the last 11 Gameweeks have seen Mark take what looks like an unassailable lead on his podcast co-host.
Join Az and Mark as they talk about where its gone wrong for Az, how Mark has turned it round… and of course, listen as they discuss how to collect points going forward in a truly unpredictable season.
Clearly, there’s plenty to discuss for the BlackBox Crew to discuss then, they’ll also be tackling all the usual stuff:
Gameweek Review
Top 10k Stats and the Great and the Good Standings
Team data – Defence and Attack!
Player Data
GW 20 fixtures and
Captain Matrix and Data
...and more!
----------------------------------------------
👍 🖋️ Don't forget to Like this video and Subscribe to FPL BlackBox… https://bit.ly/3jwrN96
 
⚽ … and join the FPL BlackBox league!
Code: v8tx2p
https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/v8tx2p
 See acast.com/privacy for privacy and opt-out information.

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
