      <itunes:summary>It’s a week into 2021 and… well, it’s carnage.
What was billed as a pivotal week in our seasons seems to have descended into a bit of a farce. Will any games go ahead at all? Will those that were planning to use their Free Hit chip be able to? What about those that have planned to navigate this blank GW without the use of the chips?
Clearly, there’s plenty to discuss for the BlackBox Crew to discuss then. And they’ll also be tackling all the usual stuff:
