      <title>FPL BB – Ep. 13 – Paying The Premium</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>Episode 13 of FPL BlackBox sees Az and Mark joined by FPL royalty. James Egersdorf emerges from his hiatus to talk Fantasy Football again, as the trio discuss GW 11 and look ahead to GW 12.  
It was a disastrous week for Az, but a good week for his illustrious co-hosts.
There’s plenty to discuss for the BlackBox Crew, and they’ll be tackling:
Gameweek Review
BlackBox learnings
Top 10k Stats and the Great and the Good Standings
Team data – Defence and Atack
Player Data – Will Salah Start? KDB vs. Bruno
DWG 19 !
GW 12 fixtures and
Captain Matrix and Data
...and more!
