      <description>Episode Eight of FPL BlackBox sees Az and Mark discuss what happened in GW 7, we well as having a think about what we can learn from a hectic start to the 2020 season.
Az can breathe a sigh of relief that his Wildcard did well, rising a million places in the ranking – but the threat of going Harry Kane-less looms over him.
There’s plenty to discuss for the BlackBox Crew, and they’ll be tackling:
Gameweek Review
BlackBox learnings
Top 10k Stats and the Great and the Good Standings
Spurs
Aston Villa
Defences
Captains
...and more!
 
