    <item>
      <title>FPL BB -- Ep. 6 - The Comforts of Madness</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>Episode Six of FPL BlackBox sees Az and Mark try to get their heads around yet another crazy Gameweek. An absolute gem of a pick comes off for one of the managers, while everything else continues to be a bit .... meh. What can we do to get a handle on things?
Listen in to find out as they discuss:
Where do Mark and Az rank in The Great and the Good?
The Top 10k corner – how are they getting on?
Team stats so far – who demands attention, and who is less important to consider?
Liverpool defence with ADRIAAAAN
Player stats and KPIs
...and an interesting finding about shots conversion..
The show is live on YouTube at 9 p.m. every Thursday, so be sure to check it out! bit.ly/34EWvZ0
 See acast.com/privacy for privacy and opt-out information.

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
