    <item>
      <title>FPL BB - Ep. 4 - Timo Time</title>
      <link>https://soundcloud.com/fplblackbox</link>
      <description>Episode Four of FPL BlackBox sees Az and Mark joined with their first-ever guest, maverick manager Luke Williams (a.k.a. @d1sable).It's been a particularly punishing week for the three managers, with an absence of the top scoring players in their squads. With Luke having already played his wildcard and Az and Mark playing the more patient game, it's the perfect time to reflect back on the first 2 weeks and see if there are any lessons that can be learned.The show is live on YouTube at 9 p.m. every Thursday, so be sure to check it out! https://bit.ly/34EWvZ0
 See acast.com/privacy for privacy and opt-out information.

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
